
@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam monochrome false
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title UC-04 Select LaTeX Template and Generate Resume Code - Collaboration Diagram
object User
object TemplatePage
object TemplateController
object LatexService
object ResumeRepository
object ResumeTemplateRepository
object ResumeTemplate
object LatexTemplateAgent
object LatexCode

User --> TemplatePage : 1. choose template
TemplatePage --> TemplateController : 2. query/generate
TemplateController --> LatexService : 3. generateLatex()
LatexService --> ResumeRepository : 4. load resume detail
LatexService --> ResumeTemplateRepository : 5. load template record
LatexService --> ResumeTemplate : 6. read latex file
LatexService --> LatexTemplateAgent : 7. generate code
LatexTemplateAgent --> LatexCode : 8. output latex code
LatexService --> TemplatePage : 9. return download link
@enduml
